{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>無綫台慶紅地氈向來是女藝人們爭妍鬥麗之戰場，現正就讀大學3年級的新生代小花Emily周智敏今年再度登場。她一改以往青春甜美乖乖女形象，以一身極具視覺衝擊力打扮震撼全場。這種破格蛻變背後隱藏著她在演藝路上充滿野心之獨特佈局。</p>\n<h2>周智敏紅髮銀紗戰衣大騷豐滿身材</h2>\n<p>Emily今年於台慶夜現身電視城外景通道時，徹底告別去年青春公主風。她染上一頭搶眼紅棕色大波浪長捲髮，身穿銀白色閃片透視薄紗大裙擺晚裝，心形低胸剪裁搭配裸色透視網紗，大方展示事業線。戰衣設計充滿巧思，高領閃鑽頸圈垂墜著水晶珠串流蘇，雙臂配有飄逸多層次珠串流蘇肩鏈，轉身回眸間盡顯成熟嫵媚女人味。</p>\n<h2>周智敏親自剖白平衡學業與事業心得</h2>\n<p>面對外間對其破格造型高度關注，Emily在後台受訪時大方分享近況。她透露為了參與前輩羅嘉良演出環節及台慶遊戲部分，事前足足排練約2星期。作為大學3年級學生，她坦言修讀演藝相關科目能讓讀書與幕前工作相輔相成，並預計再過1年畢業後便會全力投入演藝圈。她更提及早前獨自前往德國旅行，笑言拍下泳衣照令好姊妹Jenny直呼「流鼻血」。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542323077157498_13015112556b03fbff6c8c0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"918033853_17960403159259339_5378147946307552844_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542323077157498_13015112556b03fbff6c8c0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542323452741643_8204808856b03fc02dc4fc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"emchow816_1795262683_4035278142938868144_64694652193.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542323452741643_8204808856b03fc02dc4fc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542323691919173_13307143916b03fc055bb6b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"emchow816_1795262683_4035278158340516970_64694652193.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542323691919173_13307143916b03fc055bb6b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>保留舊物配襯經典雙C耳環成標記</h2>\n<p>回顧Emily去年紅地氈造型，當時她以一襲香檳金色細肩帶深V心形低胸貼身閃片晚裝示人，搭配清爽高馬尾與蜜桃色妝容，充滿校園少女活力。縱使2年間由青春躍升至冷艷風格，她耳際依然佩戴同一款經典雙C閃鑽吊墜耳環，成為戰衣配搭中一大標誌。她在抽獎環節前亦重提舊事，指去年與名車大獎僅差一個號碼，並祈求今年身處香港能真正贏得座駕。</p>\n<h2>網民對Emily性感大解放評價兩極化</h2>\n<p>這組紅地氈及後台靚相曝光後迅速在各大社交平台引發激烈討論。部分網民對其大膽突破表示讚賞，留言稱「完全睇唔出係大學生」、「紅髮造型超有氣質」。不過亦有部分觀眾認為她年紀尚輕，批評新路線過於成熟，直指「都係鍾意佢以前清純乖乖女多啲」、「着到咁真係有啲唔敢直視」。社交平台上關於她下一年畢業後發展方向討論依然持續不斷。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17954232406287725_1333886556b03fc0919988.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"emchow816_1763806474_3771404476969235761_64694652193.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17954232406287725_1333886556b03fc0919988.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>回顧Emily去年紅地氈造型，當時她以一襲香檳金色細肩帶深V心形低胸貼身閃片晚裝示人（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542324331530729_5082070946b03fc0bc6872.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"emchow816_1763806474_3771404485072636222_64694652193.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542324331530729_5082070946b03fc0bc6872.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542324639871929_10642376256b03fc0ebe120.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"emchow816_1763806474_3771404491380824678_64694652193.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542324639871929_10642376256b03fc0ebe120.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542324831395414_19058932946b03fc10aa1dd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"emchow816_1763806474_3771404461173449975_64694652193.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542324831395414_19058932946b03fc10aa1dd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:54:08.494431+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1204,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:40:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T09:37:24.590370+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T08:47:36.462104+00:00","content_hash":"c2b9e8ac340aed0096025e3255b3087af27c2ba487b68373a048e10528551709","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}